{
  "id": "coin-change",
  "order": 8,
  "title": "Coin Change",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "pattern": "Dynamic programming",
  "statement": "Given coin denominations `coins` (unlimited supply of each) and an `amount`, return the fewest coins needed to make that amount, or `-1` if it cannot be made.",
  "constraints": [
    "1 <= coins.length <= 12",
    "1 <= coins[i] <= 2^31 - 1",
    "0 <= amount <= 10^4"
  ],
  "function": {
    "name": "coinChange",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "coins",
        "type": "int[]"
      },
      {
        "name": "amount",
        "type": "int"
      }
    ],
    "returns": "int"
  },
  "complexity": {
    "time": "O(amount * coins)",
    "space": "O(amount)"
  },
  "hints": [
    "Does always taking the largest coin work? Try coins [1, 3, 4] and amount 6.",
    "Let best(v) be the fewest coins for value v. How does best(v) relate to best(v - c) for each coin c?",
    "Bottom-up DP: dp[0] = 0, dp[v] = 1 + min(dp[v - c]) over coins c <= v; unreachable values stay at infinity."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          2,
          5
        ],
        11
      ],
      "expected": 3,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "5 + 5 + 1."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2
        ],
        3
      ],
      "expected": -1,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Odd amounts cannot be made from 2s."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1
        ],
        0
      ],
      "expected": 0,
      "hidden": false,
      "explanation": "Zero coins make amount 0."
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          186,
          419,
          83,
          408
        ],
        6249
      ],
      "expected": 20,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          2,
          5,
          10,
          1
        ],
        27
      ],
      "expected": 4,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          3,
          7
        ],
        5
      ],
      "expected": -1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1,
          3,
          4
        ],
        6
      ],
      "expected": 2,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          4,
          17,
          23,
          28
        ],
        69
      ],
      "expected": 3,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          8,
          16,
          21
        ],
        108
      ],
      "expected": 6,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ],
        91
      ],
      "expected": -1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          12,
          15,
          16,
          19
        ],
        26
      ],
      "expected": -1,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          12,
          16,
          26
        ],
        40
      ],
      "expected": 3,
      "hidden": true
    },
    {
      "args": [
        [
          1
        ],
        5
      ],
      "expected": 5,
      "hidden": true
    }
  ]
}
